# Terraform fixtures and Rego policies are hashed byte-for-byte by the plan cache
# (scripts/auto_test/auto_test.py: fixture_sha). Pin them to LF so a Windows checkout
# and a Linux CI runner see identical bytes.
#
# The committed blobs are already LF, so adding this changes nothing in git history —
# it stops a CRLF blob being committed in future. auto_test also normalises CRLF before
# hashing, which is what makes existing Windows worktrees work; this is the belt to
# that pair of braces.
*.tf    text eol=lf
*.rego  text eol=lf
